{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263ypVJ5dkKb1792754512.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞殘運，港隊於乒乓及羽毛球增添2銀3銅。</p><p></p><p>焦瑾珊及王愉程於女子雙打WD14級，四強3-1擊敗泰國，決賽則0-3不敵國家隊，奪得銀牌，仍創兩人亞殘運雙打項目最佳成績。</p><p></p><p>王婷莛及吳玫薈WD22級雙打，循環賽後排第二，亦獲銀牌。</p><p></p><p>兩面銅牌來自男子MD18級的何嘉盛及王志賢，以及MD22級的溫偉樂及袁景誠。羽毛球的朱文佳在男子SH6級亦獲銅牌。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:39.522733+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T11:20:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T13:58:16.302266+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:18:23.939248+00:00","content_hash":"3b67aa7a50b28c783c054b68cf62f3cd50db3232eae0155d86d83db2f0cd3683","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:24:39.522733+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}